					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030911,
					"content": "啊…我…您是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030912,
					"content": "他好像被魈的氣場嚇得不會說話了欸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030913,
					"content": "敢問…敢問仙名是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030914,
						111030915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030914,
					"content": "「降魔大聖」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030916
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111030916,
					"content": "真的是您！沒想到真的是您！居然有生之年可以見到「降魔大聖、護法夜叉」本尊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030917,
					"content": "你也知道魈的事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030918,
					"content": "當然，不如說倒背如流！我爺爺是民俗學者，我從小就是聽「降魔大聖」的故事長大的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030919,
					"content": "至今也常常在收集有關夜叉的各類書籍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030920,
					"content": "可是自從在爺爺的遺物裡，找到了「百無禁忌籙」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030921,
					"content": "一開始我只是喜歡模仿仙人，裝裝樣子，可是後來就在邪路上越走越遠了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030922,
					"content": "還有這種往事…那這麼說你是魈的粉絲囉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030923,
					"content": "是、是。感謝兩位讓我有機會見到「降魔大聖」的真身，簡直像真的在作夢一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030924
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030924,
					"content": "其實我們也沒想到這一步啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030925
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030925,
					"content": "今天我就藉此機緣，在「降魔大聖」面前立誓…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030926
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030926,
					"content": "從此一定棄惡揚善、安穩度日，不再敗壞仙人的聲譽！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030927
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030927,
					"content": "我會記得你的誓言…去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030928
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030928,
					"content": "謝謝…謝謝您的原諒，還有您為璃月做過的一切…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030929
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030929,
					"content": "他最後的誓言，很誠懇呢。應該真的不會再招搖撞騙了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030930
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030930,
					"content": "對了，「百無禁忌籙」還沒回收，就交給我們吧，明天一早我們就去望舒客棧，找他本人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111030915,
					"content": "「護法夜叉」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030916
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111030904,
					"content": "終於不再自稱「本仙」了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030905
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111030905,
					"content": "不敢了，不敢了，都要被你們打得魂飛魄散了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111030906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "掇星攫辰天君"
				}
			]
		},
